//! Generated: specialised superinstructions for the hottest instruction
//! runs. Regenerate with `tools/gen_spec.py` from a counters build; the file
//! is checked in, so nothing depends on the profile at build time.
//!
//! Each function runs a fixed sequence of ALU instructions whose registers and
//! immediates are compile-time constants. Values that a later instruction in
//! the run reads are forwarded through a local, so the sequence touches the
//! register file only for what the outside world can see. Every instruction is
//! trap-free, so there is nothing to fall back to in the middle of a run.

